<title>USA: Bernard Chaus has no comment on stock move.</title>
<headline>Bernard Chaus has no comment on stock move.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bernard Chaus Inc said it had no comment on its stock's unusual activity Friday, according to the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company's stock was down 10/32 on very light volume in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>The NYSE said it contacted the company and requested it issue a public statement indicating whether any corporate developments were causing the stock's unusual activity.</p>
<p>The company said its policy was not to comment on unusual market activity.</p>
</text>
